{
    "prompt": "\"Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes. If object is visible, move to it, take it, process it. Else, scan area. list of available nodes: <Action ID = MoveToStartLocation    /> <Action ID = ScanForObject    /> <Action ID = TakeObject    /> <Action ID = ProcessObject    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectVisible    /> <SubTree ID = ProcessObject    /> <Action ID = MoveToObject    />\"",
